            "id": 115173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Belirli bir koşulu karşılayan öğeleri bulup yeni bir diziye çıkarmak istediğimizi varsayalım.</p><p>Bunu yapmanın bir yolu döngü kullanmaktır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  arr.push(element);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Calling .filter on an Array",
            "id": 115174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bunun yerine <code>.filter()</code> fonksiyonunu kullanabiliriz. <code>.filter()</code>, bir koşulu sağlayan değerlerle yeni bir dizi oluşturur.</p><p><code>.filter()</code> şu söz dizimini kullanır: <code>ArrayName.filter()</code>. Bu metodu <code>testScores</code> dizisi üzerinde çağıralım.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".map()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>testScores</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>filter</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bunun yerine <code>.filter()</code> fonksiyonunu kullanabiliriz. <code>.filter()</code>, bir koşulu sağlayan değerlerle yeni bir dizi oluşturur.</p><p>Her puanı dönüştüren metot yerine eşleşen puanları tutan metodu çağırarak <code>arr</code> dizisini oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"reduce\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"forEach\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>testScores</code>, ardından <code>.</code>, <code>filter</code>, <code>(</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing Functions",
            "id": 115175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni dizide bir değerin dahil edilip edilmeyeceğini <code>.filter()</code> fonksiyonuna belirtmek için parametre olarak bir fonksiyon geçirmemiz gerekir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>function</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni dizide bir değerin dahil edilip edilmeyeceğini <code>.filter()</code> fonksiyonuna belirtmek için parametre olarak bir fonksiyon geçirmemiz gerekir.</p><p><code>.filter()</code> içine boş bir satır içi geri çağırma fonksiyonu ekleyerek <code>arr</code> dizisini her puan hakkında karar vermeye hazırla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>function</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code> ve son olarak <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters",
            "id": 115177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Satır içi fonksiyonun dizinin öğelerine erişmesini sağlamamız gerekiyor.</p><p>Bunu yapmak için fonksiyona bir parametre eklemen yeterli. Bu durumda <code>element</code> kullanacağız, ancak herhangi bir ad işe yarar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" participants = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ben&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Eli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Henry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sean&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Annabel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sNames = participants.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;S&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(sNames);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"125\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sean' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>element</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Return",
            "id": 115176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni dizide hangi değerlerin saklanacağını <code>.filter()</code> fonksiyonuna belirtmek için fonksiyonun <code>return</code> ifadesinin bir boolean döndürmesi gerekir.</p><p>Genellikle Boole değeriyle sonuçlanan ve dizi öğesini veya dizinini içeren bir koşul yazarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"arr\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>element &gt;= 90</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.filter()</code> yeni bir dizi oluşturur. Satır içi fonksiyonu her değeri alır ve tutmak için <code>true</code> döndürür.</p><p>Yeni dizide hangi değerlerin saklanacağını <code>.filter()</code> fonksiyonuna belirtmek için fonksiyonun <code>return</code> ifadesinin bir boolean döndürmesi gerekir.</p><p>Yalnızca en az <code>90</code> olan puanları tut, ardından filtrelenmiş diziyi yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"testScores\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>element</code>, ardından <code>return</code>, <code>&gt;=</code> ve son olarak <code>90</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters II",
            "id": 115178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>filter()</code> fonksiyonuna ikinci bir parametre eklersen, her yinelemenin dizideki değerinin yanı sıra dizinine de erişebilirsin.</p><p>Bu örnekte parametreyi <code>index</code> olarak adlandıracağız, ancak herhangi bir ad kullanılabilir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" week = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sunday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Monday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tuesday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wednesday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Thursday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Friday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Saturday&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" workWeek = week.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (index &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &amp;&amp; index &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(workWeek);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"140\" endIndex=\"145\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Monday', 'Tuesday', 'Wednesday', 'Thursday', 'Friday' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>index</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Arrow functions",
            "id": 115180,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sözdizimimizi basitleştirmek için satır içi fonksiyon yerine bir JavaScript ok fonksiyonu kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>element</code>, ardından <code>=&gt;</code> ve son olarak <code>element &gt;= 90</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sözdizimimizi basitleştirmek için satır içi fonksiyon yerine bir JavaScript ok fonksiyonu kullanabiliriz.</p><p>En az <code>90</code> olan puanları tutmak için bu kısa geri çağırma söz dizimini kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" testScores = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = testScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 95, 90 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>90</code>, ardından <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>element</code> ve son olarak <code>&gt;=</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
