            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.filter()</code> içindeki satır içi fonksiyon ne tür bir değer döndürür?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir boolean</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir dize</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir boolean.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değerin <code>.filter()</code> tarafından döndürülen dizide kalması için geri çağırma fonksiyonu ne döndürmelidir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bir boolean</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir dize</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dizi öğesinin kendisini</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bir boolean öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Arrow functions",
            "id": 115282,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Neden satır içi fonksiyon yerine bir ok fonksiyonu kullanabiliriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Çünkü ok fonksiyonu söz dizimini basitleştirir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir arrow function'ın parametrelere ihtiyacı olmadığı için</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Çünkü ok fonksiyonu söz dizimini basitleştirir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>score =&gt; score &gt;= 90</code> neden bir filter geri çağırma fonksiyonundaki daha uzun satır içi fonksiyonun yerini alabilir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Çünkü ok fonksiyonu söz dizimini basitleştirir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir arrow function'ın parametrelere ihtiyacı olmadığı için</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Çünkü bir ok fonksiyonu her zaman dizi döndürür</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Çünkü ok fonksiyonu söz dizimini basitleştirir.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Calling .filter on an Array",
            "id": 115285,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>names</code> dizisinde <code>.filter()</code> fonksiyonunu çağır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" names = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tania&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vince&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Terry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = names.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tony', 'Tania', 'Terry' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>names</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>filter</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yalnızca <code>\"T\"</code> ile başlayan adları içeren bir dizi oluştur, ardından diziyi yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" names = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tania&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vince&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Terry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = names.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Vince\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Tony', 'Tania', 'Terry' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>names</code>, ardından <code>filter</code>, <code>element</code>, <code>===</code> ve son olarak <code>\"T\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Passing Functions",
            "id": 115286,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.filter()</code> fonksiyonunun içine satır içi bir fonksiyon ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" customerTotals = [\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"56\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"110\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" largeOrder = customerTotals.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>function</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters",
            "id": 115287,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizi değerlerine erişebilmesi için satır içi fonksiyona uygun parametreyi ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices = [\" /><text value=\"19.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"18.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"21.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inBudget = prices.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"price\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price &lt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inBudget);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"97\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 19.99, 18.99, 17.99 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>price</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return",
            "id": 115289,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>shortSleeveDay</code> dizisini <code>.filter()</code> fonksiyonunun doldurmasını sağlayacak doğru anahtar kelimeyi yaz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" weather = [\" /><text value=\"67\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"73\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"77\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"82\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"93\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shortSleeveDay = weather.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temp\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temp &gt; \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shortSleeveDay);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"104\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 78, 77, 82, 93 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Parameters II",
            "id": 115288,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>top3</code>, ilk üç <code>finishers</code> öğesini depolayacak şekilde parametreleri doğru sırada kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"finisher, place\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" place &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>finisher</code>, ardından <code>,</code> ve son olarak <code>place</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İkinci satır içi parametre, <code>0</code> ile başlayarak her indeksi alır. İlk parametreyi <code>finisher</code> olarak adlandır.</p><p>Her yarışmacının sırasını test ederek ilk üç yarışmacıyı tut, ardından <code>top3</code> dizisini yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"finisher, place\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" place &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"135\" /><option startIndex=\"136\" endIndex=\"137\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"finishers\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>finisher</code>, ardından <code>place</code>, <code>&lt;</code> ve son olarak <code>3</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Arrow functions",
            "id": 115290,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Öğe dizini 3'ten küçükse <code>true</code> döndüren bir arrow fonksiyonu kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"finisher, place\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" place &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"111\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>(finisher, place)</code>, ardından <code>=&gt;</code> ve sonra <code>place</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>3</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Birden fazla ok fonksiyonu parametresini <code>(finisher, place)</code> gibi parantez içine al.</p><p>İlk üç yarışmacıyı tutmak ve <code>top3</code> dizisini yazdırmak için bir ok fonksiyonu kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finishers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sarah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sally&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" top3 = \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" finishers.filter(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"finisher, place\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" place &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(top3);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Sarah', 'Sally', 'Jake' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>(finisher, place)</code>, ardından <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>place</code>, <code>&lt;</code> ve son olarak <code>3</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
